Subject: [PATCH] Use literal Esirkepov shape-factor slots on Metal

Metal miscompiles runtime-indexed local-array stores in the Esirkepov shape
factor helper. Express the same upstream zero-then-redeposit mapping with
literal slot stores and scalar slot accessors, preserving the ordinary and
implicit FieldGather paths, including RZ. The literal-slot form is
semantically identical under the helper's one-cell shift contract. The host
equivalence harness and frozen upstream reference are under
tests/warpx/validation/.

